{% About 
  title="Why do we bring colour to our partner clubs?" 
  subtitle="Our mission is to inspire and nurture our sports community – by helping coaches grow professionally and allowing all athletes to enjoy it." 
  content="<br/><br/><span class=\"text-neutral-400\">With more than 20 years of top-level sports experience across our team, we have been fortunate to learn from the knowledge and inspiration of great coaches in football, handball, hockey, swimming, and many other sports. Thanks to that experience, we better understand today’s challenges for coaches – from performance pressure to building engagement and team spirit.</span> <br> We believe in a sporting climate where joy is the driving force behind personal and collective growth. By providing athletes, volunteers, and administrators with an environment where they feel safe, valued, and inspired, we help them bring out the best in themselves and their clubs."
/%}

